{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09123","headline":"喜於广陵拜觐家兄奉送发还池州 · 韦应物","name":"喜於广陵拜觐家兄奉送发还池州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青青连枝树，苒苒久别离。\n客游广陵中，俱到若有期。\n俯仰叙存殁，哀肠发酸悲。\n收情且爲欢，累日不知饥。\n夙驾多所迫，复当还归池。\n长安三千里，岁晏独何爲。\n南出登阊门，惊飙左右吹。\n所别谅非远，要令心不怡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}